{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After an asteroid plunges the world into an endless winter the survival of the colony depends on the transportation a powerful heatcore aboard a giant experimental vehicle across the frozen wasteland to the colony.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Protected from the cold by the powerful heatcore inside the vehicle, you\u2019ll gather resources, fight off raiders, and reclaim vehicle parts the bandit stole.<br> <br>Deliver the vehicle's heatcore to humanity's colony to save them from the permanent winter </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640660/extras/856bd62aa2cea3403bfc4aa6f496ab7c.poster.avif?t=1763466812\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640660/extras/856bd62aa2cea3403bfc4aa6f496ab7c.webm?t=1763466812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640660/extras/856bd62aa2cea3403bfc4aa6f496ab7c.mp4?t=1763466812\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Exploring the world you need to harvest resources to keep the engine running, crafting ammunition for your guns, as well as finding upgrades for the vehicle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640660/extras/e4417cf3e8dc1ff62d6881417ae0df23.poster.avif?t=1763466812\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640660/extras/e4417cf3e8dc1ff62d6881417ae0df23.webm?t=1763466812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640660/extras/e4417cf3e8dc1ff62d6881417ae0df23.mp4?t=1763466812\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this hostile world you will need to protect both yourself and the vehicle. Against storms, the cold, and raiders that want the heatcore and vehicle for their own purposes. <br>Defend it by using turrets onboard your vehicle, guns, or by avoiding the raiders all together  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640660/extras/c2fd3084f987a350b7e213f3a43e12fe.poster.avif?t=1763466812\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640660/extras/c2fd3084f987a350b7e213f3a43e12fe.webm?t=1763466812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640660/extras/c2fd3084f987a350b7e213f3a43e12fe.mp4?t=1763466812\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2640660?t=1763466812","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2640660?t=1763466812","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640660/2700eaf00f5faeda4fa33960f381238360499636/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763466812","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640660/2700eaf00f5faeda4fa33960f381238360499636/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763466812","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After an asteroid plunges the world into an endless winter the survival of the colony depends on the transportation a powerful heatcore aboard a giant experimental vehicle across the frozen wasteland to the colony.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Protected from the cold by 